 producing up to 280 lightning strikes per hour for roughly 160 nights a year. This phenomenon is so consistent it was historically used as a \"natural lighthouse\" by Caribbean navigators. Interestingly, the name \"Venezuela\" (meaning Little Venice) was inspired by the indigenous stilt houses (palafitos) found here by early European explorers.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T15:54:23Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Next q", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T15:54:31Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "280 per HOUR", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T15:54:42Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Yes!", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T15:54:50Z", "username": "Srijan Naayak", "text": "Crazyy it is", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T15:55:33Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "4. Which country is home to the most number of non-polar glaciers, expected to be between 7000-13000", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T15:55:47Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Nepal?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T15:55:53Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "nepal", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T15:55:55Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Or China/Tibet", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T15:55:59Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "chile", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-29T15:56:04Z", "username": "Akshay